WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.386 --> 00:00:07.143
"Sore ja mata ne" tte te wo futte

2
00:00:07.171 --> 00:00:14.057
Muri ni waratte samishiku natte

3
00:00:20.039 --> 00:00:26.780
Hodoukyou jitensha kakaete noboru hito

4
00:00:26.871 --> 00:00:34.878
Konbini dareka no uwasabanashi

5
00:00:34.903 --> 00:00:42.080
Kousaten shingou tooku no kurakushon

6
00:00:42.105 --> 00:00:49.529
Shiranai dareka no warai au koe

7
00:00:49.557 --> 00:00:56.241
Kyou wa hitori de aruku kayoi nareta machi

8
00:00:56.271 --> 00:01:01.392
Demo itsumo yori mo nandaka

9
00:01:01.417 --> 00:01:07.586
Jibun ga chotto chiisaku omoeru yo

10
00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:12.400
"Sore ja mata ne" tte te wo futte

11
00:01:12.429 --> 00:01:17.000
Egao tsukutte samishiku natte

12
00:01:17.386 --> 00:01:24.170
Honto wa mada hanashi tarinai kedo

13
00:01:24.195 --> 00:01:27.829
"Sore ja mata ne" tte kotoba tte

14
00:01:27.857 --> 00:01:32.701
Mata aeru tte uso wo tsuite

15
00:01:32.901 --> 00:01:38.571
Itsumodoori no egao de iu yo

16
00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:42.429
"Mata ashita"

17
00:01:59.159 --> 00:02:06.871
Hitori ni wa nareteru furi wo shiteru kedo

18
00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:14.071
Honto wa sonna ni tsuyokunaishi

19
00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:21.014
Itsumo to onaji keshiki itsumo to onaji machi

20
00:02:21.043 --> 00:02:26.075
Nani mo kawaranai hazu na noni

21
00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:32.314
Jibun dake ga chiisaku omoeru yo

22
00:02:33.043 --> 00:02:37.086
"Sore ja mata ne" janakutte

23
00:02:37.114 --> 00:02:41.700
"Ato sukoshi" tte ieba yokatta

24
00:02:42.086 --> 00:02:48.529
Ki ga tsuite hoshikute kitai shiteita kedo

25
00:02:48.557 --> 00:02:52.371
"Sore ja mata ne" tte kotoba de

26
00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:56.914
Mata jibun ni uso wo tsuite

27
00:02:57.314 --> 00:03:07.246
Itsumodoori no egao de kakusu kono kimochi

28
00:03:19.157 --> 00:03:22.900
"Sore ja mata ne" tte te wo futte

29
00:03:22.929 --> 00:03:27.928
Egao tsukutte samishiku natte

30
00:03:27.957 --> 00:03:34.482
Honto wa mada hanashi tarinai kedo

31
00:03:34.507 --> 00:03:38.464
"Sore ja mata ne" tte koe sae

32
00:03:38.489 --> 00:03:43.245
Todokanai hodo chikakute tooi

33
00:03:43.271 --> 00:03:53.114
Itsumodoori ni ato ichido dake iwasete

34
00:03:53.157 --> 00:03:56.986
"Mata ashita."

